@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080
@token = paste_accessToken_from_register_or_login_here
@adminToken = paste_admin_accessToken_here
@bookingId = 1

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready

### Public fixtures (fresh demo: match 1 played, match 2 in seven days)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/events

### League table (fresh demo tournament 1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tournaments/1/standings

### Ticket inventory (fresh demo event 2; offer 1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/events/2/ticket-offers

### Register a spectator. This example password is only for a local disposable account.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Demo Spectator",
  "email": "spectator@example.test",
  "password": "Local-example-password-42"
}

### Login with the administrator password you supplied to start-demo.ps1
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "leader@arena.local",
  "password": "replace_with_your_own_password"
}

### Reserve two tickets. Repeating this body returns the same booking.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ticketOfferId": 1,
  "quantity": 2,
  "idempotencyKey": "demo-reservation-0001"
}

### View private booking and ticket codes
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/bookings/{{bookingId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cancel before the two-hour cutoff; repeated cancellation is safe
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/bookings/{{bookingId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Administrator example
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/teams
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Delta United",
  "code": "DELTA",
  "city": "Mansoura"
}
